# LinkedIn_AIHawk

#### 🤖🔍 Your AI-powered job search assistant. Automate applications, get personalized recommendations, and land your dream job faster.


## Table of Contents

1. [Introduction](#introduction)
2. [Features](#features)
3. [Installation](#installation)
