Kubernetes Deployment:

Deployed Flask backend in Kubernetes pods within a Minikube cluster.

Developed Deployment YAML files for Flask and Angular with a replica count of 2 for high availability.

Configured Service YAML files using the nodeport service type to expose the applications externally.

