### Blockchain Infrastructure (Coming Soon)
- **Network:** Ethereum (Primary) / Polygon (Layer 2)
- **Smart Contracts:** Solidity 0.8.x
- **Development Framework:** Hardhat
- **Web3 Integration:**
  - ethers.js
