```

### 3️⃣ Set up environment variables
Create a `.env` file and add:
```env
gemini_api=your_gemini_api_key_here
mongo_uri=your_mongodb_connection_string
serp_api=your_serp_api
```

### 4️⃣ Run the project
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```
