client.py,myvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,e70ad88dd28196898ac65aa21ce135c91a4e58ec,Ye-Bhone-Lin/Myanmar_Weather_News,https://api.github.com/repositories/965598131/contents/myvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py?ref=4bf5540bab8eed90b0ca357a522d9e5adca61274,https://api.github.com/repositories/965598131/git/blobs/e70ad88dd28196898ac65aa21ce135c91a4e58ec,https://github.com/Ye-Bhone-Lin/Myanmar_Weather_News/blob/4bf5540bab8eed90b0ca357a522d9e5adca61274/myvenv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,"Update Real-Time Myanmar Weather News (Cyclone, Earthquake) ",,0,0,0,10,2025-06-11T10:17:55Z,0,0,"# Myanmar_Weather_News

A web application providing real-time weather updates and earthquake alerts for Myanmar, built with Streamlit.

### 🌟 Features

- Daily Weather Reports:

Get natural-language weather updates in Burmese, tailored to your city or region.

- Real-Time Earthquake Alerts:

