client.py,.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,8307f614e5518f5a499cd0f921b21e05d0f23811,raavivenkatasuresh03072004/RAG_BUILDING,https://api.github.com/repositories/1006233529/contents/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py?ref=ae9cd920e332f91f5e67b9184bef3f524ff3c3c0,https://api.github.com/repositories/1006233529/git/blobs/8307f614e5518f5a499cd0f921b21e05d0f23811,https://github.com/raavivenkatasuresh03072004/RAG_BUILDING/blob/ae9cd920e332f91f5e67b9184bef3f524ff3c3c0/.venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/client.py,,,0,0,0,3,2025-07-17T12:01:20Z,0,0,"#  Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) using LangChain & ChromaDB

This project implements a simple **RAG pipeline** using **LangChain**, **Google vertex AI LLMs**, and **ChromaDB** to retrieve relevant documents from a local vector store and generate context-aware answers.

##  Overview

- **Embed** textual documents using `LangChain` embeddings
- **Store** them in `ChromaDB` (local vector database)
- **Query** via natural language → Retrieve → Generate answer using OpenAI LLM

---

##  Tech Stack

- Python
- LangChain
- ChromaDB
- Google Vertex AI(gemini-2.5-flash)

---

