test.py,test.py,a5cf2820bec6622274f693364d1d8033dae458a8,habibi-bd/chatbot_with_gemini_hugging,https://api.github.com/repositories/952654334/contents/test.py?ref=0aa2da6f2b722e43ef07d646fa41511cd33c3570,https://api.github.com/repositories/952654334/git/blobs/a5cf2820bec6622274f693364d1d8033dae458a8,https://github.com/habibi-bd/chatbot_with_gemini_hugging/blob/0aa2da6f2b722e43ef07d646fa41511cd33c3570/test.py,,,0,0,0,1,2025-03-21T16:40:24Z,0,0,"# AI Chat Interface with Hugging Face

A web-based chat interface that uses Hugging Face's language models for natural language processing. Built with Flask and modern web technologies.

## Features

- Real-time chat interface
- Code block formatting with syntax highlighting
- Copy-to-clipboard functionality for code snippets
- Support for markdown formatting (bold, italic)
- Responsive design

## Setup

1. Clone the repository
2. Install dependencies:
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
3. Create a `.env` file with your API keys:
```
HUGGINGFACEHUB_API_KEY=your_key_here
```
4. Run the application:
```bash
python 2.chatmodels/app.py
```
5. Open http://localhost:5000 in your browser

## Project Structure

```
.
├── 2.chatmodels/
│   ├── app.py              # Flask application
│   ├── templates/          # HTML templates
│   │   └── index.html     # Main chat interface
│   └── hugginface.py      # Hugging Face model implementation
├── requirements.txt       # Project dependencies
└── README.md            # This file
```

## Technologies Used

- Flask
- Hugging Face Transformers
- LangChain
- Bootstrap
- JavaScript "
