# MacOS/Linux/Windows WSL2
source venv/bin/activate # venv
source .venv/bin/activate # uv
# Windows
.\venv\Scripts\activate.bat # venv
.\.venv\Scripts\activate.bat # uv
```

**Install dependencies**  

