to generate the email in a specific purpose.

## Install

### Prepare the .env file

Set ""PROJECT_NAME"" and ""OPENAI_API_KEY"" in the `.env` file

### Build the docker images

```bash
docker-compose build
```

### Run the docker

```bash
docker-compose up -d
```

